A||N||11||MikeSchaefer||Central IL Fiero Show 2001, One Week!||||6||
Z||000000||MikeSchaefer||08-04-2001||06:39 PM||||The Central IL Fiero Show 2001 will be held on Saturday, August 11th at South Point Park in El Paso, Illinois.  It's free and will be from 11 AM until 5 PM. A map and some information on the show can be found here: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html</A> <BR>Last year we had around 40 cars show up throughout the day, even though it rained. It is an informal get together, and there should be a very large turn out this year. NIFE members, Gateway Fieros (including a race-Fiero being trailered up), Michigan Fieros, Minnesota Fieros and all other clubs in the area are invited and many have e-mailed me to tell of their interest.  Fiero Bob (Bob Steiger) will be there with a few cars, Archie will be there, Dave Bagwell is bringing the Predator kit, Bob Rebec will be there in his newly finished northstar Fiero, and Rodney Dickman will be showing off a few new products.  The show has gotten local attention with a write-up on the second page of a large paper (The Pantagraph).  It's a Show & Shine, no registration is required, just enjoy the show.<BR>Hope to see everyone here,<BR>Michael Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by MikeSchaefer (edited 08-04-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000001||MikeSchaefer||08-05-2001||04:51 PM||||Saturday Saturday Saturday||||reg||3
